      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "So the issue affecting midnight rooftop I've yet to track down however since this post was made the world was updated and the issue no longer occurs on this new version. I have found other worlds affected by this however they are far less visited.\n\nIf anyone finds another case similar to this please provide the world id and if you are the creator of the world please note if you are using and editor tools that run on build. \n\nImportant note: If you see \"did not pass initial checks and won't be downloaded: 10\" in the logs it is not this issue and a different canny should be made",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
