      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Try to create a new instance for the Alcove Rest world - https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_9e66b9e2-140e-42a4-90d0-881b9f5df75c\n\n3. The download progress bar completes but I am re-directed to the VRChat default home world\n\nFrom the logs:\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  No local config found at 'C:/Users/JamesBarrett/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat\\worldconfig\\wrld_9e66b9e2-140e-42a4-90d0-881b9f5df75c'\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Preparing assets...\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  [EOSManager] AntiCheat Session Begin: Success\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnCustomAuthenticationResponse\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnConnected\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnConnectedToMaster\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:09 Debug      -  [Behaviour] Connected to master in jp\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:10 Error      -  Error Downloading or Instantiating Custom Scene - Alcove_Rest - 12 - Error loading asset bundle from ****: Data Processing Error, see Download Handler error\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:10 Error      -  Attempted to remove a download handle that has been released from cache.\n\nSystem.InvalidOperationException: Attempted to remove a download handle that has been released from cache.\n\n  at ÏÏÎÌÎÍÍÌÌÌÍÏÍÌÌÍÎÌÎÏÎÌÍ.ÎÍÌÌÎÏÌÍÍÌÎÎÌÏÌÎÎÎÍÎÎÏÏ () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at ÌÌÌÎÎÌÌÌÍÌÎÌÌÏÍÏÎÎÏÍÏÏÎ.ÌÎÎÍÍÌÌÍÌÏÌÌÍÏÎÏÌÍÎÎÎÌÎ (ÏÍÏÎÏÎÍÌÌÌÍÎÌÌÌÍÌÍÎÌÌÌÌ ÌÌÍÏÏÎÎÎÍÎÌÍÍÌÎÎÌÏÏÍÏÍÌ, System.String ÌÍÍÏÎÏÌÎÍÎÌÍÎÍÌÍÌÎÍÎÏÌÍ) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at ÌÌÌÎÎÌÌÌÍÌÎÌÌÏÍÏÎÎÏÍÏÏÎ.ÌÍÏÌÏÍÏÍÏÌÏÍÌÏÏÍÏÌÏÏÎÎÌ () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at Cysharp.Threading.Tasks.UniTaskCompletionSourceCore`1[TResult].TrySetResult (TResult result) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at Cysharp.Threading.Tasks.UniTask+WaitWhilePromise.MoveNext () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n  at Cysharp.Threading.Tasks.Internal.PlayerLoopRunner.RunCore () [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0 \n\n2025.08.09 02:02:10 Debug      -  [AssetBundleDownloadManager] Average download speed: 19371282 bytes per second\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:10 Error      -  [Behaviour] Downloading the room failed.\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:10 Debug      -  [Behaviour] World download took 1,197.0ms\n\n2025.08.09 02:02:10 Debug      -  [Behaviour] <color=red>Resetting game flow because \"Downloading the room failed\": [ClearDestinationWorld, SkipLogin]</color>\n\nI saw a bug report from the Open Beta channel with the same issue so it seems this issue has not been fixed before releasing to live. Please check and identify the cause as soon as possible.\n\nOnly tested on PC - same issue happens in both VR and Desktop modes.",
